[h1]🌍 Map Translation Project[/h1]
Play any Superfighters Deluxe map in your language!

[b]6[/b] maps are currently translated including official maps and campaigns. More are added continuously.

The script automatically replaces dialogues, speaker names, signs and popups with translations while you play. No map editing is needed, and untranslated maps are left completely untouched.

Currently available languages:
[list]
    [*]Español (España) [i](es-ES)[/i]
    [*]Español (Latinoamérica) [i](es-419)[/i]
    [*]Русский (Россия) [i](ru-RU)[/i]
    [*]Português (Brasil) [i](pt-BR)[/i]
[/list]

Pick your language once with the command below and it will be remembered for every map you play.

[h2]⚙️ Commands[/h2]
[table]
    [tr]
        [th]Command[/th]
        [th]Description[/th]
    [/tr]
    [tr]
        [td]LANG [language|original][/td]
        [td]Chooses the language dialogues and texts are shown in. It applies when you enter a map. Use LANG without arguments to list every available language (e.g. es-ES, pt-BR), or LANG original to keep the map's original text. Host only.[/td]
    [/tr]
[/table]

[h2]✍️ Want this in your map's language?[/h2]
Missing a map or a language? Translations live in an open database anyone can contribute to.

Visit the [url=https://github.com/MythoFame/SFD.Scripting.MapTranslationProject]GitHub project[/url] to add translations for your favorite maps or request new ones. Contributions are included in future updates.

